OL,3,GNEWSARAF Fairford incident involves
OL,4,A'foreign actor', says Rubio
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major incident was declared at the
OL,7,Fweekend after "suspicious vehicles"
OL,8,Fwere seen near the RAF base in
OL,9,FGloucestershire, which has been used by
OL,10,FUS forces to carry out strikes against
OL,11,FIran.
